                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      If an RDF document only has a single rdf:description element covering multiple namespaces, the getSchemas () method delivers only the first namespace.<br/>
It can easily be fixed by changing line 613 to:<br/>
for (int j = 0; j &lt; attributes.getLength(); j++)<br/>
<br/>
Please see the attached file for an example.
