                                            <td class="description">      Joined a trivial patch<br/>
It removes unused style/findbug files in preflight and xmpbox subprojects. I guess common file should be used for the whole project :<br/>
* preflight/edoc-checkstyle.xml<br/>
* preflight/findbugs-exclude.xml<br/>
