                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      classes generated from javacc are not in the simple jar due to default behaviour of maven-bundle-plugin<br/>
package should be added in pom configuration<br/>
<br/>
jar-with-dependencies contains all because it is generated with maven-assembly-plugin<br/>
<br/>
--- preflight/pom.xml   (revision 1158520)<br/>
+++ preflight/pom.xml   (working copy)<br/>
@@ -61,6 +61,11 @@<br/>
         &lt;artifactId&gt;maven-bundle-plugin&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
         &lt;version&gt;2.0.0&lt;/version&gt;<br/>
         &lt;extensions&gt;true&lt;/extensions&gt;<br/>
+        &lt;configuration&gt;<br/>
+          &lt;instructions&gt;<br/>
+            &lt;Export-Package&gt;org.apache.padaf.preflight.javacc|org.apache.padaf.preflight.javacc.*&lt;/Export-Package&gt;<br/>
+          &lt;/instructions&gt;<br/>
+        &lt;/configuration&gt;<br/>
       &lt;/plugin&gt;<br/>
       &lt;plugin&gt;<br/>
         &lt;artifactId&gt;maven-assembly-plugin&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>

  </td>
