  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      The colors of the attached PDF are wrong when rendered with pdfbox 1.6.<br/>
<br/>
As a sitenote, on a Windows 2000 system I do not have access to regularly, the text was completely messed up, too. I could not reproduce this on Windows Vista, though.<br/>
<br/>
For completeness&#39;s sake, this is the code used to render the image:<br/>
            PDDocument doc=PDDocument.load(file);<br/>
            try<br/>
            {<br/>
                @SuppressWarnings(&quot;unchecked&quot;)<br/>
                List&lt;PDPage&gt; pages=doc.getDocumentCatalog().getAllPages();<br/>
<br/>
                return pages.get(0).convertToImage();<br/>
            }<br/>
            finally<br/>
            {<br/>
                doc.close();<br/>
            }<br/>

  </td>
