                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Define the behaviour of the StreamValidationHelper when the COSStream provided by the PDDocument.getDocument().getObject() is missing from the XRef Table.<br/>
Currently, control on stream is done except for the length validation because we are using the offset provided by the XRefTable.<br/>
<br/>
The way to check the stream length was developed at the beginning of the preflight project. <br/>
Maybe there are a better way using the PDFBox object to process it now or perhaps no control must be done if the object is missing from the Xref table
  </td>
