my code is :- <br/>
<br/>
                PDDocument doc = PDDocument.load(&quot;pdf file path&quot;);<br/>
                PDFTextStripper stripper = new PDFTextStripper();<br/>
                Result = stripper.getText(doc);<br/>
<br/>
this code is running and working fine. but in case of few pdf(specially when it has images)<br/>
It was giving the error of missing assembly bcprov-jdk14-132.  i add the reference of this assembly.<br/>
now it is again giving the following error on the third line of fetching text.<br/>
