                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Re-factoring the method parseHeader() method to support an extra header declaration : &quot;%CSO-&quot;.<br/>
<br/>
This header is foundable into some XFDF document, when the stamp appearance stream is define as complete COSDocument. This special document use &quot;%CSO-1.0&quot; as header declaration.<br/>
<br/>
So I purpose to enhance the PDFReader to be able to parse this kind of document.<br/>
<br/>
Pierre Huttin
