                <tr id="issuerow12527207" rel="12527207" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-1139" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-1139" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-1139">PDFBOX-1139</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Problem in COSWriter.visitFromDictionary() method with signature dictionnary entries
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Not A Problem
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Fanny PUAUD
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Fanny PUAUD
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 14/Oct/11 14:38 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 06/Nov/14 06:15 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 06/Nov/14 06:14 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.6.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Signing            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I was unable to save my signed PDF because the COSWriter.visitFromDictionary() method is expected a specific order for entries of the signature dictionnary. <br/>
COSName.CONTENTS entry is expected before COSName.BYTERANGE, if not, the &#39;reachedSignature&#39; boolean is not correctly setted<br/>
The order shouldn&#39;t be considered since entries of the signature dictionnary are not ordered<br/>
<br/>
Thank you for considering this problem.<br/>
<br/>
Regards,<br/>
Fanny PUAUD
  </td>
