                <tr id="issuerow12530832" rel="12530832" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-1163" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-1163" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-1163">PDFBOX-1163</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Allow to change the default TextPositionComparator in pdfTextStriper
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> New Feature</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Won&#39;t Fix
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Sébastien Dailly
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Sébastien Dailly
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 09/Nov/11 08:28 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 17/Jun/14 19:51 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 17/Jun/14 19:51 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Text extraction            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      All
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      As mentioned in the mailing list, the pdfTextStriper does not allow to change the default textPositionComparator used for orderning the char on the page.<br/>
<br/>
Here is a patch for a setter :<br/>
<br/>
23a24<br/>
&gt; import java.util.Comparator;<br/>
69c70,76<br/>
&lt;     //enable the ability to set the default indent/drop thresholds<br/>
---<br/>
&gt;     /**<br/>
