                <tr id="issuerow12541582" rel="12541582" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-1224" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-1224" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-1224">PDFBOX-1224</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Angle units are not consistent
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Wish</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            jypllx
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            jypllx
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 07/Feb/12 09:00 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 13/Dec/14 14:15 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 11/Oct/14 21:57 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.6.0,                     2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.8.8,                     2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Documentation,                     PDModel            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      ubuntu 10.04
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi Devs,<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;ve noticed that the angle units are not consistent throughout pdfbox. For instance, org.apache.pdfbox.pdmodel.PDPage.setRotation() needs a angle in degrees while org.apache.pdfbox.pdmodel.edit.PDPageContentStream.setTextRotation() needs an angle in radians...<br/>
The javadoc does not specify which units are taken as arguments.<br/>
<br/>
It would save devs a bit of time to know that all angles are to be provided in degrees or radians.<br/>
<br/>
Thanks and keep up the good work !!<br/>
jy
  </td>
