                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Using SVN trunk revision 1291094 (2012-02-18)<br/>
Getting the following stack trace when trying to call PDField.setValue() on a AcroForm field in the attached document;<br/>
<br/>
java.lang.NullPointerException<br/>
	at org.apache.pdfbox.pdmodel.interactive.form.PDAppearance.calculateFontSize(PDAppearance.java:551)<br/>
	at org.apache.pdfbox.pdmodel.interactive.form.PDAppearance.insertGeneratedAppearance(PDAppearance.java:371)<br/>
	at org.apache.pdfbox.pdmodel.interactive.form.PDAppearance.setAppearanceValue(PDAppearance.java:281)<br/>
	at org.apache.pdfbox.pdmodel.interactive.form.PDVariableText.setValue(PDVariableText.java:131)<br/>
<br/>
Reason seems to be that PDApperance.getFontAndUpdateResources() returns null, in turn because the font dictionary for the DA of the field (&quot;/Cour 11 Tf 0 g&quot;) is not present in the document.
  </td>
