                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        PDFBOX-1067                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      In 1.7.0 trying to build an image (jpg) from a PDF that is a JBIG2 encoded image results in a blank image being created.<br/>
In 1.6.0 an image with a skewed black box is created.<br/>
<br/>
In my logs I see:<br/>
2012-03-06 14:54:20,333 [http-bio-8080-exec-10] [INFO] unsupported/disabled operation: BDC<br/>
