</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Windows 7; JDK 1.6
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      PDNumberTreeNode setNumbers(Map numbers) uses &quot;Names&quot; rather than &quot;Nums&quot; as key for Nums entry in NumberTreeNode dictionary.<br/>
Any number tree node updated this way will, upon execution of getNumbers(), return null, and will in fact be an invalid NumberTreeNode<br/>
<br/>
Line in method with problem is #256:<br/>
<br/>
         node.setItem( &quot;Names&quot;, array );
  </td>
