                                            <td class="description">      I use the panel which is front of the axAcroPDF.<br/>
I draw rectangle the point of which I got exactly.<br/>
Then I put this POINT(left top right bottom) as parameters in <br/>
Rectangle2D POINT = new Rectangle(left, top, right, bottom);<br/>
stripper.addRegion(&quot;testRegion&quot;, POINT);<br/>
to extract region to Powerpoint<br/>
But the ectangle does not match what i want<br/>
POINT(left top right bottom)<br/>
May anyone help me to solve this problem?<br/>
Many thanks.
