                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Windows 7, JDK 1.6
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Some of the PDF files that contain CID fonts (which are parsed by class PDType1CFont) do not produce correct images.<br/>
This is, I think, because the created AWT font by PDType1CFont.getawtFont method is not right.<br/>
The AWT font do not return correct glyphs for either of the unicode characters or code points.<br/>
I will attach a sample PDF to demonstrate the case.
