                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      FDFDictionary finds &quot;fields&quot; tag and then parses all of it&#39;s descendants which tag name is &quot;field&quot;. But that is wrong, because only direct children of &quot;fields&quot; tag should be handled by FDFDictionary. All the other fields are handled recursively by FDFField constructor.
