                <tr id="issuerow12551235" rel="12551235" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-1290" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-1290" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-1290">PDFBOX-1290</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                CloseFillNonZeroAndStrokePath operator fails to do the stroke.
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Andreas Lehmkühler
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Martin Schrodt
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Martin Schrodt
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 17/Apr/12 14:56 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 29/May/12 16:21 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 17/Apr/12 16:23 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.6.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.7.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Swing GUI            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      should make no difference<br/>
Version of PDFBox is 1.6.0
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      When displaying or printing a PDF that uses the CloseFillNonZeroAndStrokePath OperatorProcessor, the stroke is not done.<br/>
<br/>
This is because the FillNonZeroRule which is executed before the stroke calls PageDrawer.fillPath(), which does a reset of the path via getLinePath().reset().<br/>
After the reset, the path is empty, so the stroke operation just does nothing.<br/>
<br/>
I helped myself by changing CloseFillNonZeroAndStrokePath.java like this:<br/>
<br/>
public void process(PDFOperator operator, List&lt;COSBase&gt; arguments) throws IOException {<br/>
    context.processOperator( &quot;h&quot;, arguments );<br/>
    // clone the path<br/>
    PageDrawer pd = (PageDrawer) context;<br/>
    GeneralPath p = (GeneralPath)pd.getLinePath().clone();<br/>
    context.processOperator( &quot;f&quot;, arguments );<br/>
    // and restore before calling stroke<br/>
    pd.setLinePath(p);<br/>
    context.processOperator( &quot;S&quot;, arguments );<br/>
}<br/>
<br/>
This seems like a hack, so you guys probably know a cleaner way to fix this.<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
