Apr 26, 2012 2:41:12 PM org.apache.pdfbox.pdmodel.font.PDSimpleFont drawString<br/>
Warnung: Changing font on &lt; &gt; from &lt;AMAKEA+TimesNewRoman&gt; to the default font<br/>
Apr 26, 2012 2:41:13 PM org.apache.pdfbox.pdmodel.font.PDSimpleFont drawString<br/>
Warnung: Changing font on &lt; &gt; from &lt;AMAKEA+TimesNewRoman&gt; to the default font<br/>
