                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      To fix the PDFBox-1274 issue, the  validation of PDF/A needs a refactoring.<br/>
Currently, each XRef entry is checked independently. <br/>
Most of the time, this is enough because the required information to validate the object are present in the object.<br/>
<br/>
For the issue PDFBox-1274,  the object validation should access to the page that uses the object.<br/>
<br/>
After the refactoring the valdiation unit will be the PDPage.<br/>
<br/>

