                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      While NonSequentialPDFParser uses SecurityHandler for decryption and also provides a method to get the handler it does not assign it to generated PDDocument thus classes without access to parser object cannot retrieve access permissions.<br/>
<br/>
In this issue the necessary changes to NonSequentialPDFParser, PDDocument and tools using it will be collected.
