  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Open 19472133.PDF PdfboxReader without &quot;-nonSeq&quot; parameter.<br/>
Turn to page 3, many NullPointerExceptions are displayed, and pdfviewer can&#39;t show any text.<br/>
<br/>
java.lang.NullPointerException<br/>
	at org.apache.pdfbox.util.PDFStreamEngine.processEncodedText(PDFStreamEngine.java:366)<br/>
	at org.apache.pdfbox.util.operator.ShowTextGlyph.process(ShowTextGlyph.java:62)<br/>
	at org.apache.pdfbox.util.PDFStreamEngine.processOperator(PDFStreamEngine.java:556)<br/>
	at org.apache.pdfbox.util.PDFStreamEngine.processSubStream(PDFStreamEngine.java:270)<br/>
