                <tr id="issuerow12596409" rel="12596409" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-1351" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-1351" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-1351">PDFBOX-1351</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                False paragraph caused by superscript (1.7 regression)
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Andreas Lehmkühler
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Daniel Bonniot de Ruisselet
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Daniel Bonniot de Ruisselet
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 29/Jun/12 14:56 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 17/Mar/16 19:08 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 20/Dec/14 13:27 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.7.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Text extraction            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">1</td>
                                            <td class="watches">3</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      On the attached minimal example document, text extraction seems to be confused by the superscript, and generates three paragraphs where there is only one.<br/>
<br/>
Note that 1.6 is processing this case well:<br/>
<br/>
