                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi,<br/>
<br/>
I updated my local repository with the last revision of the XMPBox.<br/>
I encounter a validation issue on five PDF/A that were valid before.<br/>
<br/>
In attachment, there are  the XMP stream.<br/>
The XMPBox parser expects a text content in a &lt;rdf:seq&gt;&lt;rdf:li&gt; element, but in this XMP there are a rdf:Description as content.<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
BR,<br/>
Eric
