  </td>
                                            <td class="description">       org.apache.pdfbox.pdfparser.NonSequentialPDFParser parse() method is not getting the PDF version number declared in a pdf file&#39;s PDF header -- when the parse() returns the COSDocument, that COSDocument contains the hard-coded (this itself should be reported as a separate bug) value of %PDF-1.4<br/>
