                <tr id="issuerow12604609" rel="12604609" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-1396" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-1396" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-1396">PDFBOX-1396</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                The Length of stream should be written directly, not by reference
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Invalid
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Juraj Lonc
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Juraj Lonc
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 23/Aug/12 13:33 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 11/Oct/14 01:07 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 11/Oct/14 01:07 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.7.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Writing            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The Length value of stream is written by reference:<br/>
&quot;2 0 obj<br/>
&lt;&lt;<br/>
/Length 8 0 R<br/>
/Subtype /XML<br/>
/Type /Metadata<br/>
&gt;&gt;<br/>
stream&quot;<br/>
<br/>
but it is always better to tell parser the length of stream BEFORE the stream comes to parser. Currently parser gets that information after stream was read, which is sort of useless...<br/>
Proper structure should look like this:<br/>
&quot;2 0 obj<br/>
&lt;&lt;<br/>
/Length 3576<br/>
/Subtype /XML<br/>
/Type /Metadata<br/>
&gt;&gt;<br/>
stream&quot;
  </td>
