                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Polygon objects added to existing page are not shown in Adobe Reader
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
