</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      PDFStreamEngine calculates width of space (line 357):<br/>
<br/>
spaceWidthText = (font.getFontWidth( SPACE_BYTES, 0, 1 )*glyphSpaceToTextSpaceFactor);<br/>
<br/>
In some cases the result is 0.<br/>
Problem is that getFontWidth requires code number of &quot; &quot;.<br/>
<br/>
If there is &quot;ToUnicode&quot; mapping for that font that it is necessary to lookup CMap for code number and NOT to use 0x20 (space) as it is in souce code.
  </td>
