                                            <td class="description">      I have a pdf that has embedded fonts. When I load the file with the pdfbox-app-1.7.1.jar PDFReader I get the message below. When I look at the PDF the characters are not rendered properly. This works properly on PDF readers of the Ipad, iOS, and AdobeAcrobat windows.<br/>
