                <tr id="issuerow12618013" rel="12618013" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-1457" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-1457" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-1457">PDFBOX-1457</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                wasted work in TrailerValidationProcess.compareIds()
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Adrian Nistor
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Adrian Nistor
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 28/Nov/12 16:47 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 16/Dec/12 10:47 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 16/Dec/12 10:47 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate">0</td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate">0</td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">            0%
    </td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The problem appears in revision 1414788.  I attached a four-line patch<br/>
that fixes it.  This problem and the attached patch are similar the<br/>
previously fixed PDFBOX-1447 and its patch.<br/>
<br/>
In method &quot;TrailerValidationProcess.compareIds&quot;, the loop over<br/>
&quot;af.toList()&quot; (outer loop) should break immediately after &quot;isEqual&quot;<br/>
becomes &quot;false&quot;, because &quot;isEqual = isEqual &amp;&amp; oneIsEquals;&quot; can never<br/>
become &quot;true&quot; again.<br/>
<br/>
The loop over &quot;al.toList()&quot; (inner loop) should break immediately<br/>
after &quot;oneIsEquals&quot; is set to &quot;true&quot;.  All the iterations after<br/>
&quot;oneIsEquals&quot; is set to &quot;true&quot; do not perform any useful work because<br/>
the &quot;if&quot; statement depends on &quot;!oneIsEquals&quot;.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     0%
</td>
