                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The problem appears in revision 1414788.  I attached a one-line patch<br/>
that fixes it.  This problem and the attached patch are similar the<br/>
previously fixed PDFBOX-1447 and its patch.<br/>
<br/>
In method &quot;AbstractTestAction.valid&quot;, the loop over &quot;errors&quot; should<br/>
break immediately after &quot;found&quot; is set to &quot;true&quot;.  All the iterations<br/>
after &quot;found&quot; is set to &quot;true&quot; do not perform any useful work, at best<br/>
they just set &quot;found&quot; again to &quot;true&quot;.
  </td>
