                                            <td class="description">      The problem appears in version 1.7.1 and in revision 1414788.  I<br/>
attached a two-line patch that fixes it.  This problem and the<br/>
attached patch are similar the previously fixed PDFBOX-1447 and its<br/>
patch.<br/>
<br/>
In method &quot;AbstractInvalidFileTester.validate&quot;, the loop over<br/>
&quot;result.getErrorsList()&quot; should break immediately after &quot;found&quot; is set<br/>
to &quot;true&quot; if &quot;outputResult&quot; is null.  All the iterations after &quot;found&quot;<br/>
is set to &quot;true&quot; do not perform any useful work when &quot;outputResult&quot; is<br/>
null, at best they just set &quot;found&quot; again to &quot;true&quot;.
