                                            <td class="description">      I was trying to print a pdf which was generated by iText v2.1.5. Unfortunately parts of it were printed in white – the filling color was missing. I could reduce the problem to the attached PDF. When trying to print with e.g. PDocument.silentPrint I get the following info message:<br/>
