                <tr id="issuerow12631225" rel="12631225" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-1512" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-1512" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-1512">PDFBOX-1512</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                TextPositionComparator is not compatible with Java 7
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Andreas Lehmkühler
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Benjamin Papez
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Benjamin Papez
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 07/Feb/13 09:36 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 27/Nov/15 23:12 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 12/Oct/14 13:11 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.7.1,                     2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.8.8,                     2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Text extraction            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">12</td>
                                            <td class="watches">23</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        TIKA-972,                                                PDFBOX-731,                                                PDFBOX-2996                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Java 7
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      The TextPostionCompartor causes the following exception running on Java 7: Unexpected RuntimeException from org.apache.tika.parser.ParserDecorator$1@9007fa2 Original cause: Comparison method violates its general contract!<br/>
<br/>
I think the problem is with this check:<br/>
<br/>
if ( yDifference &lt; .1 ||<br/>
    (pos2YBottom &gt;= pos1YTop &amp;&amp; pos2YBottom &lt;= pos1YBottom) ||<br/>
    (pos1YBottom &gt;= pos2YTop &amp;&amp; pos1YBottom &lt;= pos2YBottom))<br/>
<br/>
as it violates the contract requirement:<br/>
<br/>
The implementor must also ensure that the relation is transitive: ((compare(x, y)&gt;0) &amp;&amp; (compare(y, z)&gt;0)) implies compare(x, z)&gt;0.<br/>
<br/>
Finally, the implementor must ensure that compare(x, y)==0 implies that sgn(compare(x, z))==sgn(compare(y, z)) for all z.<br/>
<br/>
Java 7 now is strict and throws exceptions when the contract is violated.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimespent"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="labels">    </td>
