  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      The PDFBox&#39;s MANIFEST.MF has &quot;Bundle-...&quot; entries. It should (also) support the standard<br/>
<br/>
Specification-Vendor:<br/>
Specification-Title:<br/>
Specification-Version:<br/>
Implementation-Vendor:<br/>
Implementation-Title:<br/>
Implementation-Version:<br/>
<br/>
entries so that the standard Java API of Package can be used to access the info in Java code (e.g. via getSpecificationVersion(), getImplementationVersion(), ...).<br/>

  </td>
