                                            <td class="description">      Exchange hard-coded values for variables and provide command-line options in TextToPDF component<br/>
<br/>
1) Enable the margins to be individually set from the command-line<br/>
2) Enable the font size to be represented as a floating-point value, e.g. 10.5 or 11.5<br/>
3) Allow the line-spacing to be changed from the command-line<br/>
4) Allow the page size to be changed from the command-line, e.g. A4, A3, US-Letter<br/>
<br/>
I will provide a patch for review for this added functionality
