                                            <td class="description">      TextPosition.getX() and getY() are supposed to calculate position relative to upper left corner of page.<br/>
When PDF contains CropBox then these functions return incorrect values. CropBox is ignored.<br/>
Text is relative to CropBox coordinates but calculations are made only with pageWidth and pageHeight, and that is wrong.<br/>
<br/>
&quot;page&quot; in function description means MediaBox or CropBox?<br/>

  </td>
