  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      When using the NonSequentialPDFParser, the PDDocumentInformation returned by getDocumentInformation() seems to contain all null entries, which does not occur when using the standard PDFParser. I have a large batch of PDF files which have random and strange issues that cause them to occasionally fail with the standard parser, so I was experimenting with the NonSequential parser and came across this issue.<br/>
