                <tr id="issuerow12643892" rel="12643892" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-1575" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-1575" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-1575">PDFBOX-1575</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                PDFTextStripper adds spaces after a detached words
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Not A Problem
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Andreas Lehmkühler
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Vitalie Bureanu
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Vitalie Bureanu
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 22/Apr/13 08:50 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 25/May/13 15:43 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 25/May/13 15:43 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.8.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Text extraction            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate">7200</td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate">7200</td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">            0%
    </td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Linux 64bit
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hello dear developers,<br/>
<br/>
I noticed that PDFTextStripper sometimes adds spaces after a completely detached words...<br/>
For example - if you make text extraction for attached file you will se that PDFTextStripper adds one space after words: &quot;Qty &quot; and &quot;Unit Price &quot; but not adds after &quot;Description&quot; and &quot;Line Total&quot;.<br/>
I think this is a bug, because after words &quot;Qty &quot; and &quot;Unit Price &quot; should not be present the whitespace.<br/>
Can you please fix it?<br/>
(see attach)<br/>
<br/>
Thank you very much,<br/>
Vitalie
  </td>
