                                            <td class="description">      One of our customers had major problems with PDFs designed in InDesign. TextBoxes which used any kind of native PDF effects like shadows or transparency ended up in the final JPG (using the PDFToImage conversion) as text that is surrounded by a grey box. Seeing that handling such features is most likely a new feature request, i labeled it that way. Maybe there is the chance of a possible bugfix to at least not show the grey box seen in the jpg I will upload.
