                <tr id="issuerow12645085" rel="12645085" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-1583" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-1583" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-1583">PDFBOX-1583</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                wasted work in PDDocument.addSignature(...)
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Andreas Lehmkühler
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Adrian Nistor
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Adrian Nistor
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 28/Apr/13 16:29 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 02/Jun/13 13:35 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 28/Apr/13 16:50 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.8.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.8.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The problem appears in version 1.8.1 and in revision 1476791.  I<br/>
attached a one-line patch that fixes it.  This problem is similar to<br/>
the already fixed PDFBOX-1447 and PDFBOX-1457.<br/>
<br/>
In method &quot;PDDocument.addSignature&quot;, the loop over &quot;cosObjects&quot; should<br/>
break immediately after &quot;annotNotFound&quot; and &quot;sigFieldNotFound&quot; are set<br/>
to &quot;false&quot;.  All the iterations after &quot;annotNotFound&quot; and<br/>
&quot;sigFieldNotFound&quot; are set to &quot;false&quot; do not perform any useful work<br/>
because the two &quot;if&quot; statements performing useful work depend on<br/>
&quot;annotNotFound&quot; and &quot;sigFieldNotFound&quot;.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
