                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The recent versions of Bouncy Castle didn&#39;t preserve the binary compatibility and PDFBox doesn&#39;t compile against them.<br/>
<br/>
This is an issue for the Debian project because the Bouncy Castle package has to be updated to 1.48 in order to fix a security issue. This update is going to break the PDFBox package.<br/>
<br/>
Could you please update the dependency on Bouncy Castle? I&#39;ll attach the patch with the necessary changes.
