                <tr id="issuerow12645628" rel="12645628" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-1590" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-1590" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-1590">PDFBOX-1590</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Unify logging between preflight and other modules
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Wish</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Duplicate
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Guillaume Bailleul
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Guillaume Bailleul
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Guillaume Bailleul
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 01/May/13 13:12 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 21/Jun/14 06:43 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 21/Jun/14 06:43 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Preflight            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">5</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        PDFBOX-2151                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The preflight module is the only module using log4j (version 1).<br/>
<br/>
It could be a good idea to remove it. There are really few uses of it in the product and it looks not used in a good way. It will be easy to remove.<br/>
<br/>
On the other hand, we can discuss on the opportunity to use a logger implementation in pdfbox. IMO, we should not use a logger in the core pdfbox as it is a technical API. Maybe it could be used in top level elements of pdfbox (examples, main...).<br/>
<br/>
Please vote and comment.
  </td>
