May 22, 2013 10:52:37 AM org.apache.pdfbox.util.PDFStreamEngine processOperator<br/>
INFO: unsupported/disabled operation: EMC<br/>
May 22, 2013 10:52:37 AM org.apache.pdfbox.pdmodel.font.PDTrueTypeFont getawtFont<br/>
