May 22, 2013 10:52:38 AM org.apache.pdfbox.pdmodel.font.PDTrueTypeFont getawtFont<br/>
INFO: Using font SansSerif.plain instead<br/>
Writing: C:\Users\jason.goodwin\Downloads\HoulihansVeggieMenu1.jpg
