                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hello,<br/>
<br/>
I do receive an unhandled exception during image conversion of the attached pdf file.<br/>
For image conversion i&#39;ve used the PDFToImage.java example.<br/>
The pdf file has been created with Foxit PDF-Printer.<br/>
<br/>
Every generated pdf file will crash the whole JRE, so my whole application crashes with the following trace.<br/>
The affected pdf file has been attached.<br/>
The error report file has been attached.<br/>
<br/>
Hopefully this error can be handled that the JRE won&#39;t crash anymore.<br/>
<br/>
Thanks<br/>
<br/>
#<br/>
# A fatal error has been detected by the Java Runtime Environment:<br/>
