                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      PDF&#39;s that are missing {{&lt;&lt;}} between two COS directory objects are failing with parsing. <br/>
<br/>
E.g.<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
&gt;&gt;<br/>
endobj<br/>
2 0 obj<br/>
&gt;&gt;<br/>
endobj<br/>
5 0 obj<br/>
&lt;&lt;<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
<br/>
The fix for handling these situations is adding under 20 lines of code to {{BaseParser.java}} (which I&#39;d like to contribute).
