                                            <td class="description">      Hi, I am trying to extract texts using pdfbox-app1.0.8.jar, I am able to extract it in windows xp pc but when I am trying to execute the same program in Go Daddy Linux server, the program is not working i.e not extracting the texts from the pdf. Below is the program, that I am using to extract texts from pdf files.<br/>
<br/>
