                                            <td class="description">      The curent version of PDFMergerUtility is unable to merge PDFs which are encrypted. The implemented Check in line 227 will fail due to the load mechanism in line 186 (PDDocument.load(sourceFile))<br/>
<br/>
Changing the load mechanism in line 227 to PDDocument.loadNonSeq(File file, RandomAccess scratchFile) and &quot;bouncy castle crypto&quot; dependency included the merger will be able to handle encrypted pdfs.
