</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        PDFBOX-490                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Windows
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      In class GlyphTable, method initData, contours are not set<br/>
if offset of glyph is the same as offset of previous glyph:<br/>
<br/>
            // don&#39;t repeat glyphs<br/>
            if (currentOffset == offsets[i])<br/>
            {<br/>
                continue;<br/>
            }<br/>
<br/>
Should be changed to:<br/>
<br/>
            // don&#39;t repeat glyphs<br/>
            if (currentOffset == offsets[i])<br/>
            {<br/>
                glyphs[i] = glyphs[i-1];<br/>
                continue;<br/>
            }<br/>

  </td>
