<br/>
2. Consider the input characters 「102269 工事成績」<br/>
<br/>
3. Some character positions are seen incorrectly. For example, the x coordinate of the character &quot;工&quot; is between the digit &quot;1&quot; and &quot;0&quot;.<br/>

