                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Not sure if this is useful, but I spent some time analyzing a bunch of test  PDFs from the Adobe Acrobat Engineering website, including a comparison with Adobe&#39;s Preflight component. See following blog post (which contains links to both data and raw analysis results):<br/>
<br/>
http://www.openplanetsfoundation.org/blogs/2013-07-25-identification-pdf-preservation-risks-sequel<br/>
<br/>
Needless to say the focus of this work is something Preflight wasn&#39;t really designed for, but perhaps this is nevertheless useful.<br/>
<br/>
Cheers,<br/>
<br/>
Johan
