    pdfTextStripper.setStartPage(1);<br/>
    pdfTextStripper.setEndPage(999);<br/>
    System.out.println(pdfTextStripper.getText(document));<br/>
returns this text when used with the file mentioned in PDFBOX-1436 :<br/>
