pdfbox-app-1.8.2.jar
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hello,<br/>
<br/>
I have a problem with text extraction.<br/>
The problem is not enough memory in VM during the text extraction!<br/>
<br/>
My Code:<br/>
String pdfFile = &quot;D:\testfolder\test1fd9a_test.pdf&quot;; //size of file 168 KB<br/>
PDDocument document = PDDocument.load(pdfFile, true);<br/>
<br/>
PDFTextStripper stripper = null;<br/>
try {<br/>
stripper = new PDFTextStripper();<br/>
stripper.setSortByPosition(true);<br/>
stripper.writeText(document, outputWriter);<br/>
} catch () {<br/>
}<br/>
<br/>
You get an error:<br/>
java.lang.OutOfMemoryError: Java heap space <br/>

