                                            <td class="description">      Hi everybody,<br/>
<br/>
I have a problem with images extraction from PDF.<br/>
The images have rotated 90 degrees.<br/>
<br/>
My code:<br/>
PDXObject xobject = xobjects.get(key);<br/>
PDXObjectImage image = null;<br/>
if (xobject instanceof PDXObjectImage) {<br/>
image = (PDXObjectImage) xobject;<br/>
image.write2file(outputPath);<br/>
}<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
Does anyone know what&#39;s the problem?<br/>
Thanks
