  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      After parsing the file from PDFBOX-1606 with the &quot;old&quot; parser, and doing RenderUtil.convertToImage() I get this:<br/>
27.09.2013 16:56:06.685 ERROR [main] org.apache.pdfbox.filter.FlateFilter:134 - FlateFilter: stop reading corrupt stream due to a DataFormatException<br/>
27.09.2013 16:56:06.691 ERROR [main] org.apache.pdfbox.filter.FlateFilter:134 - FlateFilter: stop reading corrupt stream due to a DataFormatException<br/>
