                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      infinite loop at org.apache.pdfbox.pdfparser.BaseParser.parseCOSHexString(BaseParser.java:1010)<br/>
<br/>
private final COSString parseCOSHexString() throws IOException<br/>
{<br/>
...<br/>
            // read till the closing bracket was found<br/>
            do <br/>
            {<br/>
                c = pdfSource.read();<br/>
            } while ( c != &#39;&gt;&#39; );<br/>
...   <br/>
<br/>
if pdfSource.read() returns EOF, the loop never terminates;<br/>
<br/>
Testcase:<br/>
PDDocument doc = PDDocument.load (new FileInputStream(&quot;...&quot;));<br/>
<br/>
2 real world pdf-files that cause the loop could be attached; do not know if their PDF is completely valid, but at least they are displayed via Preview in MacOSX.
