 <br/>
            File outFile = new File(&quot;c:/tmp/gugus.txt&quot;);<br/>
            os = new FileOutputStream(outFile);<br/>
            writer = new OutputStreamWriter(os);<br/>
 <br/>
            stripper.writeText(document, writer);<br/>
...<br/>
it takes approx 3minutes. Opening it in AcrobatReader in a few seconds.
