                                            <td class="environment">      jdk1.6
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      When i tried to extract contents from PDF&#39;s I am successfully able to extract all text with PDFBox API but getting trouble with fonts having &#39;Frutiger&#39; style. For these i am getting squared Boxes in place of characters.<br/>
<br/>
It seems PDFBox FontBox supports only 14 UTF characters set  And none of them is Frutiger style fonts. <br/>
If anybody please can suggest something. That would be of great help. I am in urgent need of the solution.<br/>

