                <tr id="issuerow12688418" rel="12688418" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-1841" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-1841" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-1841">PDFBOX-1841</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                irregular NPE In ImageIOUtils.addResolution
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Duplicate
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Andreas Lehmkühler
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            adam brin
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            adam brin
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 11/Jan/14 23:26 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 13/Jan/14 21:38 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 13/Jan/14 21:38 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.8.3            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Utilities            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">4</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        PDFBOX-1799                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Linux Java 1.7.0.44 with JAI
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      We&#39;re having an issue with PDFBox within out test suite where it sometimes throws an NPE and sometimes does not.<br/>
<br/>
h3. Background<br/>
We have a PDF File within our test suite that has JBIG2 encoded images. We have the JAI and JAI-ImageIO extensions installed with JAVA, but do *not* have a JBIG2 extension installed as discussed in PDFBOX-1067 as we need to keep with an Apache 2.0 license and cannot include the GPL3.0 jbig2-imageio.<br/>
<br/>
h3. Issue<br/>
Our issue, to be clear is *not* that we cannot handle the JBIG2 encoded images, but instead, that we&#39;re sometimes getting NPEs thrown by the system and sometimes not. (which makes it seem like it&#39;s possibly  a race condition).<br/>
<br/>
The NPE we&#39;re seeing is:<br/>
