                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The regression tests for PDFToImage are currently disabled because different JVMs produce different output because of their different implementations of AWT.<br/>
<br/>
We should investigate if these AWT differences are caused by:<br/>
<br/>
1. PNG encoding<br/>
2. Type 1 font rendering<br/>
3. anti-aliasing<br/>
4. line/curve drawing<br/>
<br/>
If the answer is anything except 4 then there will be a relatively easy fix.
