                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Here&#39;s an implementation for function based shading and 4 sample files. The implementation is rather simple. The real work is done in the function, see subtask. I&#39;m using a reverse transformation of the two matrices so that getRaster() gets the &quot;pure&quot; values. The implementation works on two test images and fails on two. I believe that the cause for the two it fails is the problem I had with Type 4 and 5. I also noticed (when debugging) that for FUNSH01.pdf, my implementation always gets the same matrices despite that its 4 different areas in that page.<br/>
<br/>
(Don&#39;t get confused by the name &quot;asy-latticeshading.pdf&quot;, its not type 5 lattice shading)
