                                            <td class="description">      Creating a PDF with a form field in Adobe Acrobat X Pro, if the field doesn&#39;t have the &quot;Scroll long text&quot; option set (which can be set in Field&#39;s Properties&gt; Options tab), PDFBox will throw an extensive list of the same exception (probably one for each char being drawn).<br/>
