	at org.apache.tika.parser.pdf.PDFParser.extractMetadata(PDFParser.java:170)<br/>
	at org.apache.tika.parser.pdf.PDFParser.parse(PDFParser.java:142)<br/>
	at org.apache.tika.parser.CompositeParser.parse(CompositeParser.java:242)<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
I can&#39;t share the triggering document, but I&#39;ll submit patch with test case shortly.
