                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The ConvertColorspace class doesn&#39;t do what a possible user might expect. It simply tries to exchange all setStrokingColor/setNonStrokingColor calls using RGB values with calls using CMYK values. It doesn&#39;t convert images or colorspaces itself.<br/>
<br/>
To avoid misunderstandings I&#39;m going to remove the class.
