  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hello, <br/>
I&#39;m printing file (test.pdf) which has on each page generated number with another font. I&#39;m using PDDocument.loadNonSeq() to load data. In logs I can see <br/>
Feb 6, 2014 3:25:26 PM org.apache.pdfbox.util.operator.pagedrawer.Invoke process<br/>
WARNING: Can&#39;t find the XObject for &#39;Xf1&#39; <br/>
and no data except that generated numbers are printed.<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;ve seen in some old bug that imageIo library was needed, but now in dependencies I don&#39;t see it (http://pdfbox.apache.org/dependencies.html)<br/>
<br/>
Please can you fix this?<br/>
<br/>
Thanks
