                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I have a PDF document with scanned images. They are XObjects called XIPlayer.<br/>
The pdf object is as below:<br/>
  q<br/>
      791.040000 0.000000 0.000000 614.400000 0.478583 -1.198583 cm<br/>
      /XIPLAYER0 Do<br/>
    Q<br/>
<br/>
For some reason using &quot;pdfimages&quot; it correctly extracts the, however PDFBox only creates empty images.<br/>
<br/>
Is there any work around?
