                                            <td class="description">      I get this with page 8 of the attached file:<br/>
<br/>
13.02.2014 20:10:10.809 WARN  [main] org.apache.pdfbox.util.PDFStreamEngine:546 - java.lang.ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException: 4<br/>
java.lang.ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException: 4<br/>
	at org.apache.pdfbox.filter.TIFFFaxDecoder.decodeT6(TIFFFaxDecoder.java:1153)<br/>
