  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Calling PDDocument.load(&quot;myPDF.pdf&quot;) throws ClassCastException.<br/>
<br/>
I will attach a short sample program and PDF.<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
2014-02-19 14:01:11,220 WARN  [org.apache.pdfbox.pdfparser.BaseParser] (main) Invalid dictionary, found: &#39;?&#39; but expected: &#39;/&#39;<br/>
Exception in thread &quot;main&quot; org.apache.pdfbox.exceptions.WrappedIOException<br/>
	at org.apache.pdfbox.pdfparser.PDFParser.parse(PDFParser.java:263)<br/>
	at org.apache.pdfbox.pdmodel.PDDocument.load(PDDocument.java:1238)<br/>
	at org.apache.pdfbox.pdmodel.PDDocument.load(PDDocument.java:1203)<br/>
