                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Some of my shading test images are sometimes flipped when done with the 1.8 branch, not with the trunk. I have observed this with shadingtype 1, 4 and 5.<br/>
<br/>
The shadingContext is created with an AffineTransform (the CTM is identical and its just a translation) of <br/>
[1.0, 0.0, 399.0]<br/>
[0.0, 1.0, 49.0]<br/>
for the 1.8 branch (bad)<br/>
<br/>
and with<br/>
[1.0, 0.0, 399.0]<br/>
[0.0, -1.0, 149.0]<br/>
for the trunk (good).<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
