                <tr id="issuerow12700631" rel="12700631" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-1972" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-1972" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-1972">PDFBOX-1972</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                WrappedIOException no longer needed in Java 1.6
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            John Hewson
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            John Hewson
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 11/Mar/14 03:40 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 17/Mar/16 19:08 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 11/Mar/14 04:14 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        PDModel            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Java 1.6 added the IOException(Throwable cause) constructor which means that WrappedIOException is no longer needed.<br/>
<br/>
WrappedIOException is never caught anywhere, only its superclass IOException is, so this is an easy change to make.
