                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      COSVisitorException is redundant, it is a simple wrapper for SignatureException, CryptographyException and NoSuchAlgorithmException and should be replaced by those exceptions directly.<br/>
<br/>
For example, we can replace:<br/>
<br/>
public void write(PDDocument doc) throws COSVisitorException<br/>
<br/>
With:<br/>
<br/>
public void write(PDDocument doc) throws IOException, CryptographyException<br/>
<br/>
and so on...
