                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      TestFilters uses Random().nextLong() to generate a seed for random data, which means that it is non-determinate. Depending on the seed value, the test may fail or succeed.<br/>
<br/>
Using the following seed results in the LZW filter failing:<br/>
<br/>
final long seed = -6257105096642706464L;
