	at org.apache.pdfbox.pdmodel.PDDocument.loadNonSeq(PDDocument.java:1135)<br/>
	at pdfboxpageimageextraction.ExtractImages.doPdf(ExtractImages.java:203)<br/>
	at pdfboxpageimageextraction.ExtractImages.main(ExtractImages.java:86)<br/>
<br/>
This didn&#39;t happen ~ 2 weeks ago, so I suspect its a regression.
