                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The &quot;logo&quot; image of the file from PDFBOX-1147.png isn&#39;t extracted because PDImageXObject.getSuffix() returns null. Changing getSuffix() so that it returns png brings us a correct file.<br/>
<br/>
With some other images, e.g. the raw_image_demo.pdf file, getSuffix() brings an NPE when getPDStream().getFilters() returns null. This happens with images that are uncompressed. Returning &quot;png&quot; for this case also brings us a nice image.
  </td>
