                <tr id="issuerow12701944" rel="12701944" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-1990" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-1990" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-1990">PDFBOX-1990</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Support creating PDF from lossless encoded images
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 17/Mar/14 18:00 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 17/Mar/16 19:06 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 23/Mar/14 04:37 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Currently we support the insertion of TIFF and JPEG into a PDF, but not PNG. We can pass a BufferedImage, but this one will be JPEG compressed which is not a good thing for graphics with sharp edges. I suggest that we support PNG as well. It is possible because the Flate Filter supports both directions.<br/>
<br/>
My implementation (coming in a few minutes) is just an RGB based start that begs for improvement.
  </td>
