  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I&#39;m converting a pdf into an image. Since I have updated the Java Runtime Environment from JRE 7 Update 17 to JRE 7 Update 51 text will not be rendered.<br/>
<br/>
PDDocument doc = PDDocument.load(is);<br/>
PDPage page = (PDPage) (pages.get(0));<br/>
BufferedImage image = page.convertToImage(BufferedImage.TYPE_INT_RGB, 100);<br/>
<br/>
Example PDF:<br/>
http://www.swm.de/dms/swm/dokumente/m-wasser/gesunde-ernaehrung.pdf<br/>
<br/>
Example Output:<br/>
https://db.tt/1pogAuU8
